<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Rgeos on KevCaz's Website</title><link>https://kevcaz.github.io/tags/rgeos/</link><description>Recent content in Rgeos on KevCaz's Website</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><copyright>Content under CC0 1.0 Universal unless otherwise specified.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 02 Feb 2019 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kevcaz.github.io/tags/rgeos/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>rgeos v0.4-2</title><link>https://kevcaz.github.io/notes/2019/02/2019-02-02_rgeos_v0_4/</link><pubDate>Sat, 02 Feb 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://kevcaz.github.io/notes/2019/02/2019-02-02_rgeos_v0_4/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;As explained in a &lt;a href="../../notes/r/rgeos"&gt;previous note&lt;/a&gt;, a few weeks ago I was not able to install &lt;a href="https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rgeos/index.html"&gt;&lt;code&gt;rgeos&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; version 0.4-1. I ran into a new issue today and I decided to figure out what was wrong with it. After a quick search, I found &lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/53042751/when-trying-to-install-rgeos-r-cannot-find-lgeos"&gt;this answer on &lt;i class="fa fa-stack-overflow" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and it turned out that all I needed was to install &lt;a href="https://packages.debian.org/sid/libgeos&amp;#43;&amp;#43;-dev"&gt;libgeos++-dev&lt;/a&gt; and so I did:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo apt install libgeos++-dev
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;After that the command:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Rscript -e &amp;#34;install.packages(&amp;#39;rgeos&amp;#39;)&amp;#34;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;worked like a charm! I guess this is mentioned somewhere in the doc, I obviously missed something (as far as I understand, &lt;code&gt;libgeos++-dev&lt;/code&gt; was not required before version v0.4-x, only &lt;code&gt;libgeos-dev&lt;/code&gt;). Anyway, once again, thanks to the &lt;i class="fa fa-stack-overflow" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; users!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Something wrong with rgeos 0.4-1?</title><link>https://kevcaz.github.io/notes/2018/11/2018-11-07_something_wrong_with/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Nov 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://kevcaz.github.io/notes/2018/11/2018-11-07_something_wrong_with/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The last update of &lt;a href="https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rgeos/index.html"&gt;rgeos (version 0.4-1)&lt;/a&gt;
was released on October 19th, 2018 and with my current R set up:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-R" data-lang="R"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;sessionInfo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;R&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;version&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;3.5.1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;2018-07-02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;Platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;x86_64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;pc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;linux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;gnu &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;bit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;Running&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;under&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;Debian&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;GNU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;Linux&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;buster&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;sid&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;I got the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-R" data-lang="R"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;checking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;geos_c.h&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;presence&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;usability...&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;yes&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;checking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;geos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;linking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;libgeos_c...&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;no&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;usr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;bin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;ld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;cannot&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;find&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;lgeos&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;collect2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;ld&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;returned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;exit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;configure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;Install&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;failure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;compilation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;linkage&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;problems.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;configure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;initGEOS_r&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;found&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#286983"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;libgeos_c.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;ERROR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;configuration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;failed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#286983"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; ‘&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;rgeos&lt;/span&gt;’
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;removing&lt;/span&gt; ‘&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;kevcaz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;x86_64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;pc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;linux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;gnu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;3.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;rgeos&lt;/span&gt;’
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;My version of &lt;code&gt;libgeos-dev&lt;/code&gt; is 3.7.0-1 and I think I had this before
the update of the R package. I tried to find a way to fix this and found this
&lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/52922060/rgeos-package-installation-error-on-linux-google-compute-instance-r"&gt;answer on &lt;i class="fa fa-stack-overflow" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; claiming that it is a bug. The build indeed fails for &lt;a href="https://cran.r-project.org/web/checks/check_results_rgeos.html"&gt;r-release-linux-x86_64&lt;/a&gt;
but there is no more details&amp;hellip; So, as recommended in the answer, I downgraded
to version 0.3-28:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>